From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:57:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 009/260] [ae-patch] Show the session's context and every usage
 row in the plan limits popover

The popover behind the composer's context ring now follows Claude Code's own
usage popover: the session's context window (used of max, with a thin bar
split into cached, cache-write and new input tokens), the 5-hour window,
weekly for all models, weekly per model, usage credits spent of the cap, and
the plan name beside the harness. Rows a reading lacks leave a one-line hint.
The context row reads the chat store the ring reads, so ChatPage.tsx is
unchanged.

It also closes when its window loses focus. Radix dismisses on a press or
Escape inside its own document only, so in the split view, where each pane
is an iframe, a click or Escape in another pane left it open.

Only files patch 0006 added change; no upstream file is touched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ARYpHueYHo2KVPpxUhx8u1
